---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Free Lifetime Repair
permalink: /free-lifetime-repair/
---
{# Free Lifetime Repair - Adjusted (Figma 35122:1207); the URL is the live site's. No phone frame exists, so phones
   follow the Repair Services and About phone frames. Changes to the frame, for a page whose job is to get a repair
   requested:
   - Hero: the "*" after the intro links to the fine print (the frame's hidden "btn" 35122:1303 stays hidden).
   - "What's Included" cards are information, not links: no arrow and no hover, so they don't promise a page.
   - "Request a Free Repair" (35122:1338) is the repair pages' request strip with the client's title and line, with
     one download button instead of a button and an inline link to the same form.
   - "See all restrictions & exclusions" and the FAQ link jump to the fine print at the end.
   - The FAQ loads closed (Figma's open third answer is an example state); every question has an answer.
   No copy is added beyond what helps the visitor act: the rest is the client's (35098:38806) or the old site's. #}
{% import "macros/ui.njk" as ui with context %}
{% import "content/macros.njk" as c with context %}
{% set l = contentPages.lifetime %}
{# Jump targets land 24px under the sticky header (the page's scroll-padding-top covers the header itself). #}
{% set anchor = "scroll-mt-6" %}

{{ ui.breadcrumbs([{ label: "Repair Services", href: "/repair-services/" }, { label: "Free Lifetime Repair" }]) }}

{# Hero: the surgeon photo, mirrored, under the About navy fade (Figma 15% to 65%). From 1920px the photo is Figma's
   107.5% of the frame (2064px, 144px past the right edge, top-aligned) and grows with the screen. From lg to 1920 it
   stays 2064px and slides further past the right edge as the screen narrows (right: 31.9% - 756px, -144px at 1920,
   -430px at 1024), so the surgeon stays clear of the 593px text column. Phones and tablets have no room beside the
   text: the photo covers the hero with the surgeon on the right, under a 60% navy tint that keeps the white text
   readable over his light gown. #}
{{ c.hero({
  title: "Free Lifetime Repair", eyebrow: "Repair Services", text: l.intro, figma: "35122:1294", image: "f188b990",
  fade: contentPages.gradients.aboutFade, footnote: { href: "#restrictions", label: "Restrictions and exclusions apply" },
  photo: "inset-0 h-full w-full -scale-x-100 object-cover object-[30%_center] lg:inset-auto lg:right-[min(-7.5%,calc(31.9%_-_756px))] lg:top-0 lg:h-auto lg:w-[max(2064px,107.5%)] lg:max-w-none",
  scrim: "bg-primary-500/60 lg:hidden"
}) }}

{# Who qualifies, right under the hero: a full-width #f1f5f8 band of styleguide trust badges (34747:15477: 52px navy
   icon, title, text), like the "why us?" band under the Home hero; three columns from xl. #}
<section class="bg-secondary-100" aria-label="Who qualifies" data-figma="35126:1378">
  <ul class="container-page grid gap-5 py-6 md:gap-6 md:py-8 xl:grid-cols-3">
    {% for e in l.eligibility %}
    <li class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-4" data-figma="{{ e.figma }}">
      <span class="flex h-[52px] w-[52px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-500 text-white">{% icon e.icon, "h-7 w-7" %}</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-0.5">
        <span class="text-lg font-medium text-ink">{{ e.title }}</span>
        <span class="text-base text-body">{{ e.text }}</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<div class="bg-white" data-figma="35122:1309">
  <div class="container-page flex flex-col gap-10 py-10 md:gap-[60px] md:py-[60px]">

    {# Confidence block, as the client's frame (35098:38871): on white, no box, the seal (248x260 at 1600) beside the
       title and text from md, the restrictions link under the text. Phones, compact: the title on the left with an
       80px seal in the top-right corner beside it, the text and link full width under them, 12px apart. The text
       keeps the 756px reading width. #}
    <section id="eligibility" aria-labelledby="eligibility-title" class="{{ anchor }} grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_80px] items-start gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:flex md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-8 xl:gap-11" data-figma="35098:38871">
      <span class="relative col-start-2 row-start-1 block h-[84px] w-20 shrink-0 overflow-hidden md:h-[168px] md:w-40 xl:h-[260px] xl:w-[248px]">
        <img src="{{ 'a3c1af5e' | img }}" alt="Free Lifetime Repair seal" class="absolute left-[-7.41%] top-[-3.98%] h-[107.96%] w-[112.96%] max-w-none">
      </span>
      <div class="contents md:flex md:min-w-0 md:flex-1 md:flex-col md:items-start md:gap-6">
        <h2 id="eligibility-title" class="col-start-1 row-start-1 text-h3 font-medium tracking-title text-heading md:text-h2 md:font-bold md:tracking-normal">{{ l.confidence.title }}</h2>
        <p class="col-span-2 max-w-[756px] text-base text-body md:text-lg">{{ l.confidence.text }}</p>
        <a href="#restrictions" class="link col-span-2 justify-self-start text-base">See all restrictions &amp; exclusions</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    {# What's Included: the styleguide category card (14714:57254) without the arrow and hover, as nothing opens.
       Two columns until xl; titles wrap rather than cut off, Medium 20/28 until the cards are wide enough for 24/32.
       Flat photos get the category cards' diagonal turn (card.style), clipped to the photo box.
       "FREE" is not in the title but on a small gold seal in the photo's empty bottom-left corner, the shape and colours
       of the Free Lifetime Repair stamp, tilted like a sticker (screen readers get it as the title's first word); 56px
       on phones, 72px from md. #}
    <section aria-labelledby="included-title" class="flex flex-col gap-4" data-figma="35122:1315">
      <h2 id="included-title" class="text-h3 font-medium tracking-title text-heading md:text-h2 md:font-bold md:tracking-normal">What's Included?</h2>
      <p class="text-base text-body md:text-lg">On qualifying Ambler brand instruments, including manipulators and hooks.</p>
      <svg aria-hidden="true" class="absolute h-0 w-0"><defs><linearGradient id="free-seal-fill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#fde8b4"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#f6c66a"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#eda43c"/></linearGradient></defs></svg>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 md:gap-6 xl:grid-cols-4" data-figma="35122:1317">
        {% for card in l.included %}
        <li class="flex min-w-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded border border-primary-500 bg-white" data-figma="{{ card.figma }}">
          <h3 class="flex min-h-[47px] items-center bg-menu px-[11px] py-2 text-sm font-bold leading-[18px] text-primary-500 md:min-h-14 md:px-5 md:py-3 md:text-h4 md:font-medium md:tracking-title min-[1800px]:text-h3"><span class="sr-only">Free </span>{{ card.title }}</h3>
          <span class="relative block aspect-[364/308] overflow-hidden bg-white">
            <img src="{{ card.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-contain" {% if card.style %}style="{{ card.style }}"{% endif %}>
            <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="absolute bottom-2 left-2 h-14 w-14 -rotate-12 drop-shadow md:bottom-3 md:left-3 md:h-[72px] md:w-[72px]">
              <polygon points="50.0,0.0 56.9,6.5 65.5,2.4 70.0,10.8 79.4,9.5 81.1,18.9 90.5,20.6 89.2,30.0 97.6,34.5 93.5,43.1 100.0,50.0 93.5,56.9 97.6,65.5 89.2,70.0 90.5,79.4 81.1,81.1 79.4,90.5 70.0,89.2 65.5,97.6 56.9,93.5 50.0,100.0 43.1,93.5 34.5,97.6 30.0,89.2 20.6,90.5 18.9,81.1 9.5,79.4 10.8,70.0 2.4,65.5 6.5,56.9 0.0,50.0 6.5,43.1 2.4,34.5 10.8,30.0 9.5,20.6 18.9,18.9 20.6,9.5 30.0,10.8 34.5,2.4 43.1,6.5" fill="url(#free-seal-fill)" stroke="#f3b25a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="38.5" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="0.1 5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <text x="50" y="59" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#4d4d4d">FREE</text>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>

    {# Request a Free Repair (client 35098:38904): the repair pages' Request a Repair strip (c.requestStrip) with the
       client's title and line and the Micro Instrument strip's instruments photo at its md size and angle, 140px
       further right so it runs only under the button: the client's line is longer than "No RMA number needed." and
       would run under the photo. Phones: the Micro strip's 60% photo at its angle, its corner 110px from the right edge
       and 75px down (the line runs three lines), so the instruments show beside the short last line and under the
       button, clear of the text. #}
    {{ c.requestStrip({
      title: "Request a Free Repair", text: l.request, image: "d61fe469", figma: "35122:1338",
      photo: "left-[calc(100%_-_110px)] top-[75px] h-[287px] w-[359px] origin-top-left rotate-[29.14deg] md:left-[calc(100%_-_90px)] md:top-[-248px] md:h-[478px] md:w-[598px] lg:left-[calc(100%_-_232px)]"
    }) }}

  </div>
</div>

{# Quality Instruments. Long-Term Value. ("SEO Section" 35122:1354): the hands photo under a navy fade, text on the
   right, as drawn. From xl the fade (valueFade) is solid navy before the
   886px text column starts; below xl the text column covers the photo, so the photo sits under an 85% navy tint.
   Phones: a 160px photo strip above the navy text block, like the Repair Services band. #}
<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-primary-500" aria-labelledby="value-title" data-figma="35122:1354">
  <img src="{{ 'c2747fef' | img }}" alt="" loading="lazy" class="relative -z-10 block h-40 w-full object-cover md:absolute md:inset-0 md:h-full">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 hidden xl:block" style="background-image: {{ contentPages.gradients.valueFade }}"></div>
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 hidden bg-primary-500/85 md:block xl:hidden"></div>
  <div class="container-page flex pb-10 pt-8 md:py-10 xl:min-h-[360px] xl:items-center">
    <div class="flex max-w-[886px] flex-col items-start gap-6 md:gap-7 xl:ml-auto" data-figma="35122:1355">
      <h2 id="value-title" class="text-h3 font-medium text-white md:text-h2 md:font-bold">{{ l.value.title }} <span class="text-accent">{{ l.value.accent }}</span></h2>
      <p class="text-base text-white md:text-lg">{{ l.value.text }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{{ c.faqSection(l.faq, { section: "35122:1381", list: "35122:1384", card: "35122:1406" }, "") }}

{# Restrictions & Exclusions: the fine print the "*" and the restriction links jump to, straight under the FAQ band
   with no line between them (the band has no lines on this page), in the 756px reading width. #}
<section id="restrictions" aria-labelledby="restrictions-title" class="{{ anchor }} bg-white" data-figma="35122:1416">
  <div class="container-page flex flex-col gap-4 pb-10 pt-8 md:pb-[60px] md:pt-10">
    <h2 id="restrictions-title" class="text-base font-bold text-heading">*Restrictions &amp; Exclusions of the Free Lifetime Repair Program</h2>
    {% for r in l.restrictions %}
    <p class="max-w-[756px] text-sm text-body"><strong class="font-bold text-heading">{{ r.label }}</strong> {{ r.text }}{% if r.link %} <a href="{{ r.link.href }}" class="link">{{ r.link.label }}</a>{{ r.after }}{% endif %}</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
